<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.2pt;"><img src="2509.04448v1/figures/logo2.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:21/21;" width="21" height="21" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
